body:
This `aria` block is nested under `DashboardWidgetSchema`, but ARIA attributes are injected from top-level `ariaLabel`/`ariaDescribedBy`/`role`. As-is, the widget ARIA config won’t produce `aria-*` attributes and can end up being passed through as an invalid `aria="[object Object]"` prop if a renderer spreads props onto DOM. Prefer flattening to top-level fields or handling `aria` explicitly in the widget renderer.
```suggestion
  ariaLabel?: string;
  ariaDescribedBy?: string;
  role?: string;
}

/**

/**
```

This nested `DashboardSchema.aria` won’t be picked up by `SchemaRenderer`’s ARIA injection (which looks for top-level fields). It’s also risky if dashboard renderers spread props onto DOM because it can produce an invalid `aria="[object Object]"` attribute. Prefer flattening to top-level `ariaLabel`/`ariaDescribedBy`/`role` (and avoid passing a raw object).
```suggestion
   * These are defined as top-level props so SchemaRenderer can inject them correctly.
   */
  ariaLabel?: string;
  ariaDescribedBy?: string;
  role?: string;
```

`spec.aria` is assigned to `node.aria`, but `DashboardRenderer` spreads props onto a DOM `<div>`. This can result in an invalid `aria="[object Object]"` attribute and still not set `aria-label`/`role` because `SchemaRenderer` only injects ARIA from top-level `ariaLabel`/`ariaDescribedBy`/`role`. Map `spec.aria.*` onto top-level fields and avoid passing the raw object through.
```suggestion
  if (spec.aria) {
    if (spec.aria.ariaLabel) node.ariaLabel = spec.aria.ariaLabel;
    if (spec.aria.ariaDescribedBy) node.ariaDescribedBy = spec.aria.ariaDescribedBy;
    if (spec.aria.role) node.role = spec.aria.role;
  }
```

Widget ARIA is passed through as `node.aria = widget.aria`, which won’t be converted into `aria-*` attributes by `SchemaRenderer` (expects top-level fields). Prefer flattening `widget.aria.*` onto `node.ariaLabel`/`node.ariaDescribedBy`/`node.role` so renderers get proper DOM attributes without needing custom handling.
```suggestion
  if (widget.aria) {
    if (widget.aria.ariaLabel) {
      // Map to top-level ariaLabel so SchemaRenderer can emit aria-label
      (node as any).ariaLabel = widget.aria.ariaLabel;
    }
    if (widget.aria.ariaDescribedBy) {
      // Map to top-level ariaDescribedBy so SchemaRenderer can emit aria-describedby
      (node as any).ariaDescribedBy = widget.aria.ariaDescribedBy;
    }
    if (widget.aria.role) {
      // Map to top-level role so SchemaRenderer can emit role attribute
      (node as any).role = widget.aria.role;
    }
  }
```
